<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADS ENDS AT $43-7/8 (FIM 199.77).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADS ENDS AT $43-7/8 (FIM 199.77).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADS closed up $0-7/8 at $43-7/8 in New York on Monday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 199.77 markka. In Helsinki on Friday, Nokia closed up 6.50 markka at 196.50.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADS (two shares) closed up $0-1/2 at $33 on Wall Street. The price equals about 75.13 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed flat at 75.50 markka.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADS closed up $0-1/8 at $21 in New York (95.62 markka). In Helsinki, Rauma closed up one at 96.00 markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
</text>
